-- ONYO: hii inafuta shughuli ZOTE za zamani kwenye jedwali 'activities'.
-- Imefungwa kwenye transaction: ikikosea, hakuna kinachobadilika.
-- Kabla ya kuendesha, hakikisha jedwali lina safu hizi (Table Editor):
--   category, title_en, title_sw, description_en, description_sw
